      "saw35_title": "Submerged Arc Welding Service | 35 m SAW Machine, Konya | ArmaWeld",
      "saw35_meta_desc": "Long linear seams, boom and chassis welding on our 35 m submerged arc welding (SAW) machine. EN 1090 and EN ISO 3834-2 certified subcontract SAW with qualified WPS.",
      "saw35_og_title": "35 m Submerged Arc Welding: Long Seams, Booms and Chassis | ArmaWeld",
      "saw35_breadcrumb": "Submerged Arc Welding",
      "saw35_label": "New equipment · Submerged Arc Welding (SAW · ISO 4063-121)",
      "saw35_h1": "35 m Submerged Arc Welding for <span>Long Seams, Booms and Chassis</span>",
      "saw35_lead": "We have added a 35-metre submerged arc welding machine to our equipment. Long linear seams, machinery and crane booms, and vehicle and machine chassis are welded continuously, with repeatable quality and a qualified WPS.",
      "saw35_cta_quote": "Request a Quote →",
      "saw35_cta_methods": "Welding Methods",
      "saw35_trust1": "35 m machine length",
      "saw35_trust2": "EN 1090 EXC3",
      "saw35_trust3": "EN ISO 3834-2",
      "saw35_trust4": "Qualified WPS",
      "saw35_svc_label": "Submerged Arc Welding Services",
      "saw35_svc_h2": "The right process for long, heavy seams",
      "saw35_svc_desc": "In submerged arc welding the arc burns beneath a layer of granular flux. High deposition, deep penetration and a smooth bead mean fewer passes and fewer stop-start points than MAG on long, heavy-section joints.",
      "saw35_c1_tag": "Linear Welding",
      "saw35_c1_h3": "Linear long-seam welding",
      "saw35_c1_p": "Girders, box sections, plate butt joints and tank shells: the 35 m machine length lets long seams be welded in one set-up at constant speed and parameters. Fewer start and stop points mean fewer defects.",
      "saw35_c2_tag": "Boom Welding",
      "saw35_c2_h3": "Boom welding",
      "saw35_c2_p": "Corner and butt seams on the box sections of excavator, crane and aerial platform booms. Booms under fatigue loading get continuous, uniform seams with a controlled welding sequence and distortion monitoring.",
      "saw35_c3_tag": "Chassis Welding",
      "saw35_c3_h3": "Chassis welding",
      "saw35_c3_p": "Long side members and I/box-section carriers for trailers, semi-trailers, agricultural and construction machinery chassis. Straightness and dimensional repeatability over the full length come first.",
      "saw35_cap_label": "Capability",
      "saw35_cap_h2": "Submerged arc welding line",
