      "px_hz_57": "What is contract welded fabrication?",
      "px_hz_58": "It is contract production in which the welding company builds parts to the customer's drawings or samples using its own equipment and qualified welders. ArmaWeld provides it with approved WPS under EN 1090 and ISO 3834-2.",
